# Only go.mod, go.sum, api/, cmd/ and internal/ are needed to build, plus
# the sound prompts `make sounds` renders into build/sounds/<voice>/ (all
# of build/sounds/ is copied into the patchbay image as it is; the
# stream-bridge target copies none of it, so `make image-stream-bridge`
# needs no `make sounds`).
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!api/
!cmd/
!internal/
!build/sounds/
**/*_test.go
